# Always process update upstream warnings

When you run `pnpm run update` (or finish a deps-update branch), **do not skip** Ratspeak / MECP / MeshCom / new-org-repo watch warnings.

Process every warning in the same change: re-vendor, bump `reviewed-ref`, or add known org repos until a re-check is quiet. Only leave a warning unprocessed when intents genuinely conflict — then ask the user.
